        {
          "book": "ACT",
          "chapter": 27,
          "verse": 3
        }
      ],
      "en": "The next day, we touched at Sidon. Julius treated Paul kindly and gave him permission to go to his friends and refresh himself.",
      "ko": "이튿날 시돈에 대니 율리오가 바울을 친절히 하여 친구들에게 가서 대접 받음을 허락하더니",
      "source_text_hash": "6e840c43a2bcc864ebccb16d73e60e1b14521441faafc75b583fed8b250d8b40",
      "translation_text_hash": "5d4238a065c96daecceff13b431f421835650db1854833cc336b1dcf07358df6",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
        "이튿날 시돈에 대니 율리오가 바울을 친절히 하여 친구들에게 가서 대접 받음을 허락하더니"
      ],
      "raw_text_hashes": [
        "5d4238a065c96daecceff13b431f421835650db1854833cc336b1dcf07358df6"
      ]
    },
    {
