      "en": "After they had hoisted it up, they used cables to help reinforce the ship. Fearing that they would run aground on the Syrtis sand bars, they lowered the sea anchor, and so were driven along.",
      "ko": "끌어 올리고 줄을 가지고 선체를 둘러 감고 스르디스에 걸릴까 두려워 연장을 내리고 그냥 쫓겨가더니",
      "source_text_hash": "b618d91f101bd385142fef9bf000ec0d82edcef2e28500f1adaac619d117eee8",
      "translation_text_hash": "b3dd766ed64b02c136701ee058c5dd86ea38f4a2aee9284ff6a2e6ba58adbc91",
