      "raw_locator": [
        {
          "book": "ACT",
          "chapter": 27,
          "verse": 20
        }
      ],
      "en": "When neither sun nor stars shone on us for many days, and no small storm pressed on us, all hope that we would be saved was now taken away.",
      "ko": "여러 날 동안 해와 별이 보이지 아니하고 큰 풍랑이 그대로 있으매 구원의 여망이 다 없어졌더라",
      "source_text_hash": "b67d4d7af8049dd4018353d91c24c0cf87634acec55fa6f1cf45624b1c96a4d7",
      "translation_text_hash": "66bf058a081d339c6d78fdeaf4c53f0bf4a200844190dbad8cd75079de79f3e8",
