      "en": "Therefore, sirs, cheer up! For I believe God, that it will be just as it has been spoken to me.",
      "ko": "그러므로 여러분이여 안심하라 나는 내게 말씀하신 그대로 되리라고 하나님을 믿노라",
      "source_text_hash": "0dd7d14d0a37b1c8c437fa410a1fd23a5b8edd2e1c96c2a72257a2bfa2d05223",
      "translation_text_hash": "6462e5b2589ce09b36daeeacf1578e5c89024bc78a00cdb7e80e0f0c74a7860b",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
        "그러므로 여러분이여 안심하라 나는 내게 말씀하신 그대로 되리라고 하나님을 믿노라"
      ],
      "raw_text_hashes": [
        "6462e5b2589ce09b36daeeacf1578e5c89024bc78a00cdb7e80e0f0c74a7860b"
      ]
    },
