      "en": "But when the fourteenth night had come, as we were driven back and forth in the Adriatic Sea, about midnight the sailors surmised that they were drawing near to some land.",
      "ko": "열 나흘째 되는 날 밤에 우리가 아드리아 바다에 이리 저리 쫓겨 가더니 밤중쯤 되어 사공들이 어느 육지에 가까와지는 줄을 짐작하고",
      "source_text_hash": "4c237e41f7205b139db74e19187c8f791e64d5ba2f926a81ba32d43a5d58942f",
      "translation_text_hash": "09133951c8201ac19f4a4afe861a6cd1e6fbaa8283351edd251328acde053596",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
