      "raw_locator": [
        {
          "book": "ACT",
          "chapter": 27,
          "verse": 28
        }
      ],
      "en": "They took soundings and found twenty fathoms. After a little while, they took soundings again, and found fifteen fathoms.",
      "ko": "물을 재어보니 이십 길이 되고 조금 가다가 다시 재니 열다섯 길이라",
      "source_text_hash": "953cf13d440b00ed258ea33c09d373802a88e68567119596c506712dc5721cbc",
      "translation_text_hash": "b8cfc7b61fd9d0b951822719cad14d42a195591ab3fb16d1a0b6f7335832fa56",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
        "물을 재어보니 이십 길이 되고 조금 가다가 다시 재니 열다섯 길이라"
      ],
      "raw_text_hashes": [
        "b8cfc7b61fd9d0b951822719cad14d42a195591ab3fb16d1a0b6f7335832fa56"
      ]
    },
    {
      "canonical_locator": "bible:web:ACT:27:29",
      "sequence": 27881,
      "chapter_label": "ACT 27",
      "verse_label": "29",
      "locator": {
